  "text": "Skip to content\nABOUT\nCONTACT US\nFLIP IT\nDont flip out...\n\nTyped akuo instead of שלום? We've all been there!\nPress CTRL, SHIFT, Y and watch it flip back to normal.\nTry it now\nHow it works\n\n“Instead of furiously mashing the backspace key, just press your hotkey… \n\n( CMD SHIFT Y for Mac or CTRL SHIFT Y for Windows). In a fraction of a second, Language Flipper reads the gibberish you just typed, swaps the characters into the correct English or Hebrew letters, and instantly replaces the text right on your screen. (If you only want to fix a specific word, you can highlight it first). The best part? It automatically switches your computer’s keyboard layout to match, so you can just keep right on typing like the mistake never even happened.”\n\nDownload Now\nMac DMG\n\nDownload now and get 40 free flips\n\nWindows EXE\n\nDownload now and get 40 free flips\n\nGet Premium\n\nEnjoy unlimited flips and extra featurs\n\nOur solution\n\nStay in the zone, type with confidence, and never retype a paragraph again.\n\n \n\nLightning-Fast Flipping\nHit your hotkey to instantly convert mistyped text into the correct English or Hebrew characters in milliseconds.\nDon't just take our word for it when you can see the magic in action right now. Test the text-flipping engine directly in your browser to experience the speed.\nTry it now\n100% Local & Secure\nNo cloud APIs, no servers, and zero lag because everything runs completely offline on your machine.\nSince it never connects to the internet, it easily bypasses strict corporate IT blocks and keeps your keystrokes entirely private. Need to deploy this across your entire office or reserve unit?\nContact us\nInstant Typo Rescue\nLanguage Flipper lives quietly in your system tray, ready to rescue your typos the exact second they happen.\nStop backspacing entire paragraphs of gibberish and let the app do the heavy lifting. Get your 40 free lifetime flips today and feel the difference immediately.\ndownload free trail\nAutomatic Layout Swap\nIt doesn't just fix the text on your screen—it seamlessly switches your computer's actual keyboard layout.\nWe seamlessly command macOS and Windows to switch keyboards without any lag or frustrating permissions nightmares. Dive into the technical details to see exactly how we pull this off.\nTry it now\nThe Hard Truth\n\nA completely scientific breakdown of your daily typing struggles.\n\nGet the feeling\nTry it now\nFacebook\n \nX-twitter\n \nYoutube\n \nLinkedin\nAbout\nAbout us\nhome\nContact\nLets talk\nFlip it\nMade with ♡ by Language flipper\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms Of Service\nPrivacy Policy",
